# Optional remote-cache configuration.
# Configure a public remote cache here if you want OSS contributors to benefit
# from shared caching. Without it the build falls back to local execution.
#
# Example (BuildBuddy free tier):
#   build:remote-cache --remote_cache=grpcs://remote.buildbuddy.io
#   build:remote-cache --remote_header=x-buildbuddy-api-key=<api-key>
#
# See https://bazel.build/remote/caching for options.
